msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: BlazBlue Calamity Trigger Ukrainian Translation\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Language: uk\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=3; plural=(n%10==1 && n%100!=11 ? 0 : n%10>=2 && n%10<=4 && (n%100<10 || n%100>=20) ? 1 : 2);\n"

#. Key: ArcEveTK01_00
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: おっすー、乳の人！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK01_00"
msgid "Hey, boobie lady!"
msgstr "Привіт, Цицькаста Пані!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK01_01
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: あらタオじゃない、どうしたのこんな所で？
#. JA:   それと私の名前は「ライチ」。いい加減覚えてちょうだい。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK01_01"
msgid ""
"Oh, hello, Tao. What are you doing here?\n"
"And my name is Litchi. Can't you remember my name\n"
"already?"
msgstr ""
"О, Тао. Що ти тут робиш? І моє імʼя — Лічі. Запамʼятай\n"
"уже нарешті."

#. Key: ArcEveTK01_02
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: おう、おぼえたぞ乳の人！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK01_02"
msgid "OK, boobie lady! I remembered it."
msgstr "Ага, запамʼятала, Цицькаста Пані!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK01_03
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ま、まあいいわ。で、どこに行こうとしていたの？
#. JA:   散歩にしては少し遠出じゃないかしら？
msgctxt "ArcEveTK01_03"
msgid ""
"Uh...I guess that's fine. Anyway, where are you going?\n"
"Isn't this a little too far from home for a walk?"
msgstr ""
"Н-ну гаразд. То куди ти прямувала? Як на прогулянку, ти\n"
"забрела доволі далеко."

#. Key: ArcEveTK01_04
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 聞いておどろくニャス！
#. JA:   タオはにゃんと「とがなんとか」になったのネ！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK01_04"
msgid ""
"You're going to be surprised when I tell you neow!\n"
"Tao has become one of those \"vigi-somethings\"!"
msgstr ""
"Слухай і дивуйся, няв! Тао стала отою «мисливицею за\n"
"чимось там»!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK01_05
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: だいあくとー「らぐにゃ」を倒してオカネをもらうんだニャ！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK01_05"
msgid ""
"I'm going to make money by taking down that villain\n"
"\"Rawrgna\"!"
msgstr "Тао здолає великого лиходія Раґню й отримає гроші, няв!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK01_06
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: というわけで、乳の人。
#. JA:   これよりまちうける辛くキビシー旅のために手合わせ願うのニャ！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK01_06"
msgid ""
"So, boobie lady, spar with meow to help me prepare for\n"
"my difficult journey!"
msgstr ""
"Тому, Цицькаста Пані, побийся з Тао, щоб підготувати її\n"
"до важкої-преважкої подорожі, няв!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK01_07
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 「とがなんとか」に……「らぐにゃ」……誰、それ？
msgctxt "ArcEveTK01_07"
msgid "\"Vigi-something\"?\"Rawrgna\"? Who's that...?"
msgstr "«Мисливиця за чимось там»... «Раґня»... Хто це взагалі?"

#. Key: ArcEveTK01_08
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: まあいいわ、手合わせっていつもの組み手のことかしら？
#. JA:   相手してあげたいんだけど、私もこれから用事が――。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK01_08"
msgid ""
"Oh, well. So you'd like to spar, like we usually do?\n"
"I'm sorry, but as much as I'd like to, I have some other\n"
"pla—"
msgstr ""
"Ну гаразд. Під «побитися» ти маєш на увазі наш\n"
"звичайний спаринг? Я б залюбки, але зараз маю деякі\n"
"спра—"

#. Key: ArcEveTK01_09
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: い～く～ニャ～ス～♪
msgctxt "ArcEveTK01_09"
msgid "Heeeeere I coooome!♪"
msgstr "Тао йде-е-е, ня-я-яв! ♪"

#. Key: ArcEveTK01_10
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ふぅ、アナタも手加減っていうものを覚えなさい。疲れた。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK01_10"
msgid ""
"Phew. You're always at one hundred percent, aren't you?\n"
"I'm all tired out..."
msgstr ""
"Фух... Тобі теж варто навчитися стримуватися. Я геть\n"
"виснажилася."

#. Key: ArcEveTK01_11
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ニャラリニャリラリ～～～♪
#. JA:   乳の人相変わらずいいむにむにエアバッグゥ～。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK01_11"
msgid ""
"Meow meow mewww!♪\n"
"Boobie lady! You always have nice, comfy airbags."
msgstr ""
"Ня-ля-ля-ля-ля-а-а! ♪ У Цицькастої Пані, як завжди,\n"
"чудові мʼякенькі подушки безпеки-и-и!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK01_12
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 何かいった？
msgctxt "ArcEveTK01_12"
msgid "What did you say?"
msgstr "Ти щось сказала?"

#. Key: ArcEveTK01_13
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: にゃんにゃんにゃんでもないニャッス～。
#. JA:   いい運動になったぞ乳の人！感謝ニャス～。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK01_13"
msgid ""
"Meow meow! Nyoothing!\n"
"That was a good workout, boobie lady! Thank mew!"
msgstr ""
"Н-ня-нічого, няв! Гарно розімʼялися, Цицькаста Пані!\n"
"Дякую, няв!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK02_00
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: おおおおおおおお、まつニャまつニャ
#. JA:   そこの黒いウネウネ！ちょっとまつニャス～～～！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK02_00"
msgid ""
"OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOH! Wait, wait, neow!\n"
"You black squiggly, come back."
msgstr ""
"О-о-о-о-о-о-о! Стій, стій, няв! Чорна кривуле, зачекай на\n"
"Тао-о-о!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK02_01
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: キサマ　隔世のレプリカ　　　　用　ない
msgctxt "ArcEveTK02_01"
msgid ""
"You    You're just    replica\n"
"I         no business w     you."
msgstr "Т  — атавістична репл ка. Мені н має до тебе     ."

#. Key: ArcEveTK02_02
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ウネウネになくてもタオにはあるニャス！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK02_02"
msgid "Grrr... But I have business with mew!"
msgstr ""
"Кривулі, може, й немає до Тао діла, зате Тао має до неї\n"
"діло, няв!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK02_03
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ウネウネはタオの村を襲う奴ニャス！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK02_03"
msgid "You're the one who attacked my village!"
msgstr "Кривуля напала на селище Тао, няв!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK02_04
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ウネウネは幸か不幸か賞金首ニャス！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK02_04"
msgid ""
"I dunno if this is good luck or not, but now you have a\n"
"bounty on your head."
msgstr ""
"На щастя чи на біду, за голову кривулі призначено\n"
"нагороду, няв!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK02_05
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: そんでもってタオたちはオカネがほしいニャス！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK02_05"
msgid "And Tao needs a lot of money!"
msgstr "А Тао з друзями потрібні гроші, няв!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK02_06
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: っちゅーわけでウネウネを倒すニャス！覚悟ニャース！！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK02_06"
msgid ""
"In other words, I'm going to beat you up  and turn you in!\n"
"Let's go!"
msgstr "Тож Тао здолає кривулю, няв! Готуйся-я-я!!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK02_07
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: グプッ
msgctxt "ArcEveTK02_07"
msgid "Gffaaaha!"
msgstr "Ґпу..."

#. Key: ArcEveTK02_08
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: そうだな、キサマ　オードブル　　ても　いだろう
#. JA:   喰ってやる　ら　ちら　くるが　い
msgctxt "ArcEveTK02_08"
msgid ""
"Let me se     Mayb   I can tur  you into an hors d'oeu     .\n"
"I'll d   you    favor    Co     here."
msgstr "Так... Т  згодишся на зак ску. Я тебе зж ру, тож      пі ходь."

#. Key: ArcEveTK02_09
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 食べるのはタオの方がすごいニャス！だから負けないニャス！
#. JA:   三枚におろしてワサビ醤油でおいしく召し上がってやるニャス！！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK02_09"
msgid ""
"Tao's better at eating, meow! I won't lose!\n"
"I'm going to chop you up, dip you in wasabi soy sauce,\n"
"and eat you neow!"
msgstr ""
"Тао краще їсть, няв! Тож Тао не програє! Тао обробить\n"
"тебе на три філе й смачно зʼїсть із васабі та соєвим соусом!!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK02_10
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ……と思ったけどオマエまずそーだからゴミバコにポイニャ。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK02_10"
msgid ""
"...No, never mind. You look nasty.\n"
"I'll just throw you in the trash."
msgstr ""
"...так Тао думала, але ти на вигляд несмачна, тож полетиш\n"
"у смітник, няв."

#. Key: ArcEveTK02_11
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 信じら　　い　　まさか　　んな　つに　グヴヴ……
msgctxt "ArcEveTK02_11"
msgid "  can t be ieve it    I   lost        Gggh  Hrght..."
msgstr "Не м жу повірити... Невже я         такій... Ґв-в-в..."

#. Key: ArcEveTK02_12
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 感じた　　蒼　　蒼　あちら　感じ　　。　
msgctxt "ArcEveTK02_12"
msgid "     I feel     The Azure                 Azure over there."
msgstr "Відч в... Лазур... Лазур...      там... відч ваю..."

#. Key: ArcEveTK02_13
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: にゅ！？ウネウネ、まつニャス！！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK02_13"
msgid "Meow! Hey, squiggly, wait!"
msgstr "Ню?! Кривуле, стій, няв!!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK03_00
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ムニュ？ここはどこニャス？
#. JA:   お、そこのお面の人！ウネウネみなかったか！？
msgctxt "ArcEveTK03_00"
msgid ""
"Meow? Where am I?\n"
"Hey! You in the mask! Did you see the squiggly!?"
msgstr ""
"Мня? Де це Тао, няв? О, ти, в масці! Не бачив чорну\n"
"кривулю?!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK03_01
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 隔世のレプリカ。何故此処に居る。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK03_01"
msgid ""
"A replica from the previous age.\n"
"What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Атавістична репліка. Чому ти тут?"

#. Key: ArcEveTK03_02
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ムム？おいそこのお面の人、聞こえなかったニャスか？
#. JA:   黒いウネウネみなかったか？
msgctxt "ArcEveTK03_02"
msgid ""
"Hmm? Hey, you mask man! Did you not hear me? Meow!\n"
"Did you see a black squiggly pass by?"
msgstr ""
"М-м? Гей, чоловіче в масці, ти не почув Тао, няв? Не\n"
"бачив чорну кривулю?"

#. Key: ArcEveTK03_03
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: あと、ついでにここがどこか教えてほしいニャス！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK03_03"
msgid "Oh! Also! Where am I?"
msgstr "І ще скажи Тао, де вона опинилася, няв!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK03_04
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 之も因果か、猫よ。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK03_04"
msgid "I guess this is fate, cat."
msgstr "То й це — причинність, кішко?"

#. Key: ArcEveTK03_05
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ムキー！確かにタオは猫ニャスけど、意味わかんにゃいのニャ！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK03_05"
msgid ""
"Grrrrrr! Yeah, Tao is a cat, but I don't know what you're\n"
"talking about, meow!"
msgstr ""
"Ня-я-я! Так, Тао — кішка, але вона не розуміє, про що ти,\n"
"няв!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK03_06
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ハッ！！もしかして――頭がカワイソーな人！？
#. JA:   し、しまったニャ。ちょっと警戒ニャス……。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK03_06"
msgid ""
"Oh! Maybe you're a crazy person?\n"
"Uh oh. I need to be careful..."
msgstr ""
"А-а! Може, в тебе голівка хвора?! Ой лишенько. Треба бути\n"
"насторожі, няв..."

#. Key: ArcEveTK03_07
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ふっ、余興と謂う事か、良いだろう。其れも我が使命。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK03_07"
msgid ""
"Hmph. It appears your purpose is entertainment.\n"
"Very well then. This shall be my mission."
msgstr "Хм. Отже, це розвага. Гаразд. Це теж моя місія."

#. Key: ArcEveTK03_08
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ニャニャ！やっぱりオマエ悪いヤツだったか！
#. JA:   しかしタオは強いニャスよ！！くるならこいニャス！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK03_08"
msgid ""
"Meow! I knew it! You're a bad man!\n"
"But Tao is very strong! Bring it on!"
msgstr ""
"Няв-няв! Так ти таки лиходій! Але Тао сильна, няв!! Ну ж\n"
"бо, нападай!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK03_09
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 我は空、我は鋼、我は刃
#. JA:   我は一振りの剣にて全ての「罪」を刈り取り「悪」を滅する！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK03_09"
msgid ""
"I am the white void. I am the cold steel. I am the just\n"
"sword. With blade in hand shall I reap the sins of this\n"
"world, and cleanse it in the fires of destruction."
msgstr ""
"Я — порожнеча. Я — сталь. Я — лезо... Я єдиним мечем\n"
"пожну всі «гріхи» та знищу «зло»!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK03_10
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 我が名は「ハクメン」、推して参る！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK03_10"
msgid "I am Hakumen. The end has come!"
msgstr "Імʼя мені Хакумен. До бою!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK03_11
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: クッ、事象干渉か！邪魔をするな化け猫め！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK03_11"
msgid "Gah! How dare you interrupt me, Grimalkin!"
msgstr ""
"Кх, втручання у причинність! Не заважай, клята\n"
"відьомська кицько!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK03_12
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: おお！？お面の人～、どこに行くニャス～～！？
#. JA:   ……あらら消えちゃったニャ。もしかして、おばけ！？
msgctxt "ArcEveTK03_12"
msgid ""
"Huh!? Mask man, where are you going, meow!?\n"
"Oh!? He disappeared... *gasp* Is he a ghost!?"
msgstr ""
"О?! Чоловіче в масці, куди ти, ня-я-яв?! ...Ой, зник. Невже\n"
"привид?!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK04_00
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 起動・起動・起動・起動・認識……
msgctxt "ArcEveTK04_00"
msgid "Loading...loading...loading...loading... Complete..."
msgstr "Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Ідентифіковано..."

#. Key: ArcEveTK04_01
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: なんかひらひらするのがでてきたニャス！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK04_01"
msgid "Ooh, some kind of weird flappy thingy came out!"
msgstr "О, якась тріпотлива штука зʼявилася, няв!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK04_02
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ううう、なぜかニャニャッと魂がうずくニャス、
#. JA:   なんだかわからないニャスが、このひらひらを――
msgctxt "ArcEveTK04_02"
msgid ""
"Hmmm, I don't know why, but my soul is feeling antsy,\n"
"meow... I don't know what it is, but I must..."
msgstr ""
"У-у-у, чомусь у Тао аж душа засвербіла, няв. Тао не знає,\n"
"що це таке, але цю тріпотливу штуку..."

#. Key: ArcEveTK04_03
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: このひらひらを倒せと轟き叫ぶニャス～～～！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK04_03"
msgid "...beat the crap out of this flappy thingy!"
msgstr ""
"...душа гримить і волає: «Здолай цю тріпотливу штуку,\n"
"няв!!!»"

#. Key: ArcEveTK04_04
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 対象・認識・自律モード・起動
#. JA:   対象・認識・障害・認識・排除・容認……対象を障害と認識
msgctxt "ArcEveTK04_04"
msgid ""
"Target recognized. Auto-mode: activated.\n"
"Scanning: complete. IFF determined. Processing..."
msgstr ""
"Ціль ідентифіковано. Автономний режим активовано. Ціль\n"
"ідентифіковано. Перешкоду ідентифіковано. Усунення\n"
"дозволено... Ціль ідентифіковано як перешкоду."

#. Key: ArcEveTK04_05
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: みなぎってきたニャス～～～～！
#. JA:   覚悟するニャス～～～～～～！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK04_05"
msgid ""
"I'm feeling full of energy!\n"
"Let's goooo!"
msgstr "Тао аж розпирає від сили, ня-я-яв! Готуйся-я-я!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK04_06
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 対象の殲滅を開始します
msgctxt "ArcEveTK04_06"
msgid "Begin termination."
msgstr "Розпочинаю знищення цілі."

#. Key: ArcEveTK04_07
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ニャニャニャニャニャニャニャニャニャニャ～～～～～～
msgctxt "ArcEveTK04_07"
msgid "Meow meow meow meow meoooooow!"
msgstr "Няв-няв-няв-няв-няв-няв-няв-няв-ня-я-я-яв!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_00
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ふにゃぁああ……眠いニャス～でもお腹すいたニャス～～。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_00"
msgid "Mew... I'm sleepy... I'm hungry...meow..."
msgstr ""
"Мня-я-я... Тао хоче спати, няв... Але ще й їсти хочеться,\n"
"ня-я-яв..."

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_01_0
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: なんだか呼ばれていたような気がしないでもないけど
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_01_0"
msgid "I feel like someone's calling me, but..."
msgstr "Наче хтось кликав Тао, а може, й ні..."

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_01_1
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: それはきっと、気のせい気のせいニャ～。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_01_1"
msgid "...it's probably just my imagination."
msgstr "Та то, мабуть, лише здалося, няв."

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_02
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ポカポカニャス～、グゴ～～～……。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_02"
msgid "Mew... Mewzzzzzzzz..."
msgstr "Тепленько, няв... Хр-р-р..."

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_03_0
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: タオ、タオ～！長老様が呼んでるわよ～！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_03_0"
msgid "Tao, Taaaooooo! The elder is calling for you!"
msgstr "Тао! Тао-о-о! Тебе старійшина кличе!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_03_1
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 大事なお話があるんだって！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_03_1"
msgid "She has something important to...tell you."
msgstr "Каже, має до тебе важливу справу!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_04
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: スニャ～、スニャ～。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_04"
msgid "ZZZzzzZZZZZ..."
msgstr "Хр-няв... Хр-няв..."

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_05
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: あらあら、こんな所で寝ちゃって……仕方ないわね。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_05"
msgid "So this is where she was... What am I going to do with her?"
msgstr ""
"Ой лишенько, заснула в такому місці... Що ж із тобою\n"
"робити."

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_06_0
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: ん～、でも確かにここ、陽が差していて気持ちいい。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_06_0"
msgid "But this is an awfully nice place, with the warm sun shining in..."
msgstr "Хоча тут і справді так приємно: сонечко пригріває..."

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_06_1
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 地下にこんな所があるなんて知らなかった――
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_06_1"
msgid "I didn't know there was a place like this underground..."
msgstr "Не знала, що під землею є таке місце..."

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_07_0
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 生体兵器の末裔か。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_07_0"
msgid "The descendent of a living weapon, huh?"
msgstr "Отже, вона — нащадок біологічної зброї."

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_07_1
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 最強と呼ばれた生物から造られた割には、天使みたいな寝顔ね。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_07_1"
msgid "For a being of ultimate power, her face looks so angelic..."
msgstr ""
"А проте для створіння, виведеного з істоти, яку називали\n"
"найсильнішою, спить вона просто як янголятко."

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_08
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 六英雄の一人、「獣兵衛」か。会ってみたい気はするわね。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_08"
msgid "Jubei...one of the Six Heroes, huh?  I'd like to meet him."
msgstr ""
"Джубей — один із Шістьох Героїв... Хотілося б із ним\n"
"зустрітися."

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_09
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: あっ、そうだ、タオ。起きなさい！
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_09"
msgid "Oh, right. Tao, wake up!"
msgstr "Ой, точно. Тао, прокидайся!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_10_0
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: 長老様が村の存命をかけた、賞金獲得一大プロジェクトの話があるっていってるの
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_10_0"
msgid "The elder wants to talk to you about the plan to"
msgstr ""
"Старійшина хоче розповісти тобі про великий план\n"
"здобуття винагороди, від якого залежить доля селища."

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_10_1
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: こら～。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_10_1"
msgid "get the prize money and save the village. Hey!"
msgstr "Агов!"

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_11_0
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: スニャ～スニャ～……
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_11_0"
msgid "Mewwww Mewww...I'm so full,"
msgstr "Хр-няв... Хр-няв..."

#. Key: ArcEveTK05_11_1
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveTK_ArcEveTK05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveTK.pac)
#. Context: Arcade event: Taokaka
#. JA: もうおなかいっぱいニャ～……。
msgctxt "ArcEveTK05_11_1"
msgid "I can't eat anymore... Zzz..."
msgstr "Тао вже наїлася досхочу, няв..."
